# grpc-audit Rule

1. Follow `.agents/skills/grpc-audit/references/grpc_checklist.md` (GRPC-001 to GRPC-010). Commands: `references/grpc_commands.md`.
2. Run `scripts/scope_check.sh TARGET`, then `.agents/skills/grpc-audit/scripts/grpc_probe.py --addr host:port` (grpcurl for reflection and calls).
3. Only own read-only calls; no stream floods or admin/write methods without approval.
